{{!
    @template local_profilefields/about_facts

    The About page's facts, drawn as a drawing-sheet title block: one cell per
    fact, a small label over a large value, hairlines between. It sits under the
    hero picture when there is one and under the hero copy when there is not,
    which is why it is a partial rather than part of about_hero.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * facts - list of {value, label}
    * factcount - how many, for the column count

    Example context (json):
    {
        "facts": [{"value": "2009", "label": "Founded"}],
        "factcount": 1
    }
}}
<dl class="nit-about-titleblock" style="--nit-about-facts: {{factcount}};">
    {{#facts}}
        <div class="nit-about-cell">
            <dt class="nit-about-cell-label">{{label}}</dt>
            <dd class="nit-about-cell-value">{{value}}</dd>
        </div>
    {{/facts}}
</dl>
